  "description": "In response to the success of the popular Title series of BMX race bikes, Mongoose decided to level-up for the more advanced riders out there. The Mongoose Title Elite 24 BMX race bike is designed for intermediate skills all the way to Pro and gives you the high-end performance from a cruiser bike you need to come out of the gates hot!\n6061 Tectonic T1 biaxial hydroformed and butted aluminum frame with 86mm BB shell, 3D forged 10mm dropouts, tapered headtube, and internal cable routing. 21.75\" top tube length and frame weight of 3.3 lbs.\nDrivetrain features 175mm 2-piece 24mm hollow spindle alloy cranks with a 42T alloy chainring and BB86 press-fit sealed bottom bracket.\nArisun XLR8 24\" x 1.95\"/1.75\"race tires mounted on Xposure double wall rims with 10mm hollow axle sealed front hub and 18T cog sealed bearing cassette rear hub.\n4130 chromoly handlebar (6.5\") and fork, 50mm stem, sealed bearing headset, and Radius alloy V-brake and brake levers. Suggested rider height is 5'7\" and taller.",
